#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Absent GPUs"
msgstr "GPU Ndị Na-anọghị"

#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "GPU na-anọghị na-anọgide dị ka ndepụta nke ajụjụ data ahụ, ya mere eserese ya na faịlụ RRD ya na-anọgide na njikọ ma gosi oghere. Iwepụ ya na ajụjụ data na-akwụsị nke ahụ: na ndepụta ọzọ Cacti anaghị edepụta ya ọzọ, eserese ya na-akwụsị imelite na isi iyi data ya na-egosi dị ka nke enweghị nne na nna, a na-edebekwa faịlụ RRD ya na eserese ya ruo mgbe i hichapụrụ ha. Ndekọ GPU ahụ na-anọgide, ma GPU ahụ na-alaghachi na ajụjụ data ma ọ bụrụ na akọọ ya ọzọ."

