#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Mark Absent After"
msgstr "Kaa Dị Ka Ọ Nọghị Mgbe"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Nnọkọ nchịkọta gara nke ọma n'usoro ga-efunahụ GPU tupu e kaa ya dị ka ọ nọghị, site na 1 ruo 100. Nchịkọta dara ada, ma ọ bụ nke na-egosighị GPU ọ bụla, anaghị agụnye. GPU ndị na-anọghị na-echekwa ndekọ na akụkọ ha ma anaghị ehichapụ ha na-akpaghị aka."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "Nchịkọta GPU"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Bụrụ Ochie Mgbe"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Sekọnd mgbe ngwaọrụ were ihe atụ tupu ọnụọgụ ya akwụsị ịpụta na eserese, site na 60 ruo 86400. A na-akọwa ọnụọgụ ochie dị ka nke a na-amaghị, ya mere nchịkọta kwụsịrị na-egosi dị ka oghere, ọ dịghị mgbe ọ na-egosi dị ka ahịrị dị larịị. Ọnụọgụ oge GPU na-aga n'ihu na-agụta ka e wee nwee ike izipu ọkwa maka ya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Wepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Debe Tebụl Mgbakwunye Mgbe A Na-ewepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Mgbe a tụrụ ya akara, iwepụ plugin ahụ na-edebe ndekọ node na GPU ya. Wepụ akara ya ka iwepụ wepụ ha; buru ụzọ bupụ ha site na GPU Nodes. A naghị emetụ ngwaọrụ Cacti, isi iyi data, eserese, na faịlụ RRD aka n'ụzọ ọ bụla."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Wepụ ihe Cacti nke plugin ahụ mgbe a na-ewepụ ya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Mgbe a tụrụ ya akara, iwepụ plugin ahụ na-ewepụkwa ndebiri ngwaọrụ GPU, ajụjụ data, ndebiri data, na ndebiri eserese o bubatara, nke ọ bụla naanị ebe ọ dịghị ihe ọ bụla na-abụghị plugin na-eji ya, yana XML ajụjụ data GPU o dere, naanị ma ọ bụrụ na agbanwebeghị faịlụ ahụ. Ọ naghị ehichapụ faịlụ RRD, ngwaọrụ, eserese, ma ọ bụ isi iyi data; a na-edebe ndebiri ndị ahụ ka na-eji."

